# The working tree is the build input, not a checkout of something else: the GSC,
# weapon, menu and .cfg files are parsed by the game, and the generated sheet is
# written with LF on purpose.  Do not let Git rewrite line endings anywhere.
* -text

# The exception: the container scripts are run by Linux (bash, and the Python
# interpreter inside the image), where a stray CR breaks them - so they are
# pinned to LF even if they are checked out on Windows.
/docker/*.sh  text eol=lf
/docker/*.py  text eol=lf
